MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD=PASSWORD=)
VITE_CIDAAS_BASE_URL: the tenant URL, e.g. https://your-tenant.cidaas.eu, no trailing slash (same as Cidaas:BaseUrl in the backend)
VITE_CIDAAS_CLIENT_ID: from your cidaas SPA client (Authorization Code + PKCE)
VITE_CIDAAS_RESOURCE: optional resource indicator; Cidaas:Audience in the backend must equal the token aud (this value, or the client id when empty)
VITE_API_URL: already http://localhost:5101 in the template; check it matches the port in launchSettings.json
